    "body": "For more context see https://github.com/validator/validator/issues/433. If it is in fact the case that [standard `rel=icon` doesn’t work in mobile Safari at all](http://logs.glob.uno/?c=freenode%23whatwg&s=21%20Dec%202016&e=21%20Dec%202016#c1015173)—and to get the same effect in mobile Safari, authors/developers need to use `rel=apple-touch-icon` in their documents—then it seems unhelpful to authors/developers for the spec to make `sizes` with `rel=apple-touch-icon` a document-conformance error (and for conformance checkers to therefore have to report it to authors/developers as such).",
